    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12496" root="دره" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَارِهٌ</span></b>  [act. part. n. of 1]. [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَارِهَاتُ الدَّهْرِ</span>
<i>The assaults of time</i> or <i>fortune.</i> (IAar, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
[Hence also,] <i>One who intrudes uninvited at
feasts; a smell-feast; a spunger.</i> (JK, Sgh.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>A messenger.</i> (JK, Sgh.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  Also
(assumed tropical:)  <i>Shining, gleaming,</i> or <i>glistening, much,</i> or <i>intensely.</i> (MF, TA.)

